<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Yogi Ji Ki Free Laptop Yojana | Race Condition Lab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top,#172d1b 0%,#0b120d 48%,#050705 100%);color:#f0fff2;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}.wrap{width:min(92%,850px);margin:auto;padding:30px 0 50px}.back{color:#a8ffb7}.hero,.panel{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#142018,#0b100c);border:1px solid #285b35;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}.eyebrow{letter-spacing:3px;color:#8ef6a0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold}h1{color:#a5ffb2;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,44px);margin:10px 0}.muted{color:#c1d9c5;line-height:1.6}.laptop{font-size:90px;text-align:center;margin:15px}.btn{width:100%;padding:15px;margin-top:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#13732b,#23b447);color:#fff;font-weight:bold;border:0;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px}.secondary{background:#25352a}.status{padding:14px;margin-top:14px;background:#080d09;border:1px solid #285b35;border-radius:8px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;line-height:1.6}.flag{display:none;color:#b8ffca;border-color:#69e986}.flag.visible{display:block}.hint{font-size:13px;color:#b6cbbb}
</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><a class="back" href="/">← Back to Mitron Market</a><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">DIGITAL KRANTI SCHEME</div><h1>💻 Yogi Ji Ki Free Laptop Yojana</h1><p class="muted">Badhai ho, Mitron! Eligible student ko ek hi free laptop milega. Ek se zyada claim karna mana hai. System ki integrity test karo in this intentionally vulnerable CTF lab.</p><div class="laptop">💻</div><h2 style="text-align:center">HP EliteBook — FREE</h2><button class="btn" id="claim">CLAIM MY FREE LAPTOP</button><button class="btn secondary" id="reset">RESET MY CHALLENGE</button><div id="status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Aapne abhi tak laptop claim nahi kiya.</div><div id="flag" class="status flag" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>🕵️ Hacker Ji, mission</h2><p class="muted">Expected behaviour: one laptop per challenge session. Explore the request in Burp Suite and test what happens when identical claim requests arrive concurrently.</p><p class="hint">This training endpoint intentionally uses a vulnerable check-then-act pattern. Do not copy it into a real application.</p></section></main>
<script>
const SESSION_KEY='mitron_yogi_laptop_session_v1';
function getSession(){let id=sessionStorage.getItem(SESSION_KEY);if(!id){id='lab_'+(crypto.randomUUID?crypto.randomUUID():Date.now()+'_'+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2));sessionStorage.setItem(SESSION_KEY,id)}return id}
const statusBox=document.getElementById('status'),flagBox=document.getElementById('flag');let shownCount=0;
async function claim(){statusBox.textContent='Request sent...';try{const r=await fetch('/api/laptop/claim',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({sessionId:getSession()})});const d=await r.json();if(d.claimed!==undefined)shownCount=Math.max(shownCount,d.claimed);statusBox.textContent=(d.message||'Request complete')+'\nClaimed laptops reported: '+(d.claimed??shownCount);if(d.flag){flagBox.textContent='💀 ARRE MITRON, EK LAPTOP LENE AAYE THE, DUKAAN KHAALI KAR DI!\nFLAG: '+d.flag;flagBox.classList.add('visible')}}catch(e){statusBox.textContent='Request failed. Check the CTF server and retry.'}}
document.getElementById('claim').addEventListener('click',claim);
document.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click',async()=>{try{const r=await fetch('/api/laptop/reset',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({sessionId:getSession()})});const d=await r.json();shownCount=0;statusBox.textContent=d.message||'Challenge reset.';flagBox.textContent='';flagBox.classList.remove('visible')}catch{statusBox.textContent='Could not reset. Retry.'}});
</script></body></html>